  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to the the preparations of the establishment of an International Claims Commission for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This individual measure will enable the EU to address short and medium-term foreign policy needs and opportunities by setting up an Advance Team of the International Claims Commission for Ukraine; enabling work of the Preparatory Committee envisaged by the Resolution of the Diplomatic conference for the Adoption of the Convention Establishing an International Claims Commission for Ukraine; and implementing other necessary (e.g. administrative, legal, political, logistical, communicative) steps towards the establishment of an International Claims Commission for Ukraine. It will thus help foster international accountability for Ukraine, contributing to a future just peace and defending the rules-based international order.</narrative>
  </description>
